---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — Pinello"
  description="Terms of service for the Pinello Chrome extension."
  canonical="https://amrita-labs.com/pinello/terms/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service — Pinello</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400"><strong>Effective Date</strong>: 2026-08-05 &middot; <strong>Last Updated</strong>: 2026-08-05</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">By installing or using Pinello (the &ldquo;Extension&rdquo;), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, uninstall the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">2. Who We Are</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Pinello is operated by Amrita Labs, based in Canada. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">3. Description of Service</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Pinello is a Chrome extension that helps Pinterest creators prepare stronger Pins before publishing. It surfaces a Feed Score on Pin cards, a Pin Detail Score inside the Pin closeup, and a Pin Doctor pre-publish check inside the Create Pin workflow. Structural scoring runs locally in the browser. AI suggestions and Board Match run only when the user explicitly clicks the corresponding button.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">4. Free and Paid Tiers</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li><strong>Free tier</strong>: Feed Score badges, Pin Detail Score and Pin stats, 20 Pin Doctor checks per month, 5 AI actions per month (any mix of title suggestions, description suggestions, topic suggestions, and Board Match checks), Hide Ads on the feed. No account required.</li>
      <li><strong>Pro tier</strong>: All Free features plus additional AI actions per month, feed sorting, Hide AI Pins, and CSV export of scored Pins. Priced at USD $8.99 per month or USD $79 per year, with a 7-day free trial, unless a different offer is clearly shown at checkout.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Free and Pro feature bundles and limits may change over time. Any change to price or included features will be shown before you next renew.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-300"><strong>Fair-use limits.</strong> Pro includes reasonable-use caps on AI actions (approximately 200 AI actions per month across all AI features combined). Reasonable-use caps protect the service against abuse and unusual per-user cost. If you have a legitimate high-volume need, contact <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">You agree NOT to:</p>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>Use automated tools, multiple identities, or shared devices to bypass rate limits, fair-use caps, or free-tier limits</li>
      <li>Reverse-engineer the scoring algorithm, backend API, or subscription checks</li>
      <li>Use the Extension for spam, mass automated pin generation, or any Pinterest Terms-of-Service violation</li>
      <li>Resell access to the Extension or its backend API</li>
      <li>Submit content that violates applicable laws, Pinterest&rsquo;s Community Guidelines, or third-party rights</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">6. AI-Generated Content</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Suggestions are generated by AI (Azure OpenAI, currently GPT-4.1-mini) only when you click a suggestion or Board Match button. Suggestions are copy-only: they are placed on your clipboard for you to paste into Pinterest. Pinello never types into Pinterest fields on your behalf.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-300">You are responsible for reviewing and editing any AI-generated text before publishing. Pinello does not guarantee saves, clicks, reach, or ranking on Pinterest, and does not guarantee that AI suggestions will improve Pin performance.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>The Extension, backend code, and Pinello brand are owned by Amrita Labs</li>
      <li>Pin content you create is yours &mdash; we claim no ownership</li>
      <li>AI-generated suggestions are provided as-is; no copyright claim is made on AI outputs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">8. Payment, Trials, Cancellation, and Refunds</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>Pro is a subscription billed by ExtensionPay (via Stripe). The current price is USD $8.99 per month or USD $79 per year unless a different offer is shown at checkout.</li>
      <li>Pro includes a 7-day free trial. If you do not cancel before the trial ends, the subscription renews at the price shown at checkout.</li>
      <li>You can cancel any time through the checkout portal accessible from the Pinello Options page. Cancellation stops future renewals; access continues until the end of the paid period.</li>
      <li>Refund requests are handled case-by-case at Amrita Labs&rsquo; sole discretion. Email <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a>.</li>
      <li>If we introduce different billing models later (for example, one-time offers, promotional codes, or higher-priced plans), the applicable terms will be disclosed before purchase.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">9. Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">See our <a href="/pinello/privacy/" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details on data collection, AI processing, caches, and your rights.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">10. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">THE EXTENSION IS PROVIDED &ldquo;AS IS&rdquo; WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. We do not guarantee accuracy of scores, that AI suggestions will improve Pin performance, uninterrupted operation, or compatibility with future Pinterest updates. Pinterest may change its interface, API, or policies at any time and Pinello may temporarily degrade or fail as a result.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Pinello is an independent tool by Amrita Labs. Pinello is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Pinterest, Inc. Pinterest is a trademark of Pinterest, Inc.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim, or USD $50, whichever is greater. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, or exemplary damages, including lost profits, lost data, or lost reach on Pinterest.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">12. Service Changes and Suspension</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Extension or its backend service at any time, with or without notice, at our discretion. If we discontinue a paid feature, we will make reasonable efforts to notify affected Pro subscribers by email or in-Extension notice before the change takes effect.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">13. Dispute Resolution</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Disputes will be resolved through binding arbitration in Ontario, Canada, except where prohibited by applicable law. For consumers in the EU, UK, and elsewhere, this section does not affect any statutory consumer protection rights you have under mandatory local law.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">14. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">We may update these Terms at any time. Material changes will be signalled by updating the &ldquo;Last Updated&rdquo; date above and, when reasonably feasible, by an in-Extension notice. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. If you disagree, uninstall the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">15. Termination</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">We may terminate or suspend your access if you violate these Terms or otherwise abuse the service. You may terminate at any time by uninstalling the Extension and cancelling any active subscription in the checkout portal.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">16. Governing Law</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">These Terms are governed by the laws of Ontario, Canada, without regard to conflict-of-laws principles.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">17. Entire Agreement and Severability</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">These Terms together with the Privacy Policy constitute the entire agreement between you and Amrita Labs regarding the Extension. If any provision is held unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full force.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">18. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">For questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a></p>
  </article>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-12 flex gap-6 text-xs text-gray-500">
    <a href="/pinello/" class="hover:text-gray-400">&larr; Back to Pinello</a>
